    "detailed_description": "<strong>Spiral to Despair is a blackjack style card game infused with RPG elements set in the depths of hell.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652700/extras/32427276015802b3757c4a8535c24500.avif?t=1625850949\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652700/extras/88981818fa1dd161b7c7b2b4f05f414a.avif?t=1625850949\" /></div><br><br>You will be facing demons across the hell to solve the mystery of your origin and unravel your story.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652700/extras/84721c2df7767021cc08fa80e0e91cbc.avif?t=1625850949\" /></div><br><br> - Progress through story and clear dungeons by defeating monsters in the game of blackjack, loot items and valuables.<br> - Use potions and flasks in your encounters to enhance your abilities and stats.<br> - Enchant items, unleash legendaries and upgrade charms to get stronger.<br> - Unlock achievements by doing various tasks and progressing.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652700/extras/f7f7c3b7c8ddc9e51c3b35476633e5ed.avif?t=1625850949\" /></div><br><br>You can export your save to cloud server and access it from another devices and continue your adventure.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Spiral to Despair is a blackjack style card game infused with RPG elements set in the depths of hell.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652700/extras/32427276015802b3757c4a8535c24500.avif?t=1625850949\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652700/extras/88981818fa1dd161b7c7b2b4f05f414a.avif?t=1625850949\" /></div><br><br>You will be facing demons across the hell to solve the mystery of your origin and unravel your story.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652700/extras/84721c2df7767021cc08fa80e0e91cbc.avif?t=1625850949\" /></div><br><br> - Progress through story and clear dungeons by defeating monsters in the game of blackjack, loot items and valuables.<br> - Use potions and flasks in your encounters to enhance your abilities and stats.<br> - Enchant items, unleash legendaries and upgrade charms to get stronger.<br> - Unlock achievements by doing various tasks and progressing.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652700/extras/f7f7c3b7c8ddc9e51c3b35476633e5ed.avif?t=1625850949\" /></div><br><br>You can export your save to cloud server and access it from another devices and continue your adventure.",
